      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "It combines the feels-like temperature and chance of rain with your dog's size, age, coat and body condition, then rates it on a 1 to 5 scale. A higher number means more caution is needed. The POOPIEMATE app also suggests safe walk times for today and tomorrow."
      }
