      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What's the best time to walk a dog in summer?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Early morning or after sunset is usually safest, when temperatures and UV are lower. Avoid midday, when hot asphalt can burn your dog's paw pads."
